[[Bluegill Marsh]] is located in the western [[Wetlands]], and is the site of several [[Bluegill]] [[murloc]] camps. Many murlocs make their home here led by the ferocious [[Gobbler]]. Young travelers should tread carefully through the marsh because all the murlocs come in groups of two or three, and pulling one at a time is very tough. A few quests take you into Bluegill Marsh in hunt for murlocs or stolen goods.

